(https://github.com/misxzaiz/polaris-api/tree/v0.2.0), commit history of the
upstream project prior to the fork is retained in this repository.

Changes made in this fork (plugin id com.fax.apifox, name
apifox-polaris-api, display name "apifox-polaris-api"):

- renamed the plugin and its workbench;
- added an in-place .http / .rest source editor: syntax highlighting, JSON
  folding, a request outline, a collapsible overlay panel, and autosave back to
  the original file;
- added a bundled runnable examples.http written on first launch;
- added multipart/form-data request bodies with byte-exact file parts;
- added streamed text/event-stream (SSE) responses with a size/time cap;
- new icon and rewritten store listing text;
- from v1.1.0 this fork adds read-only pull of Apifox API trees and environments
  (no writes back to Apifox), via new Rust RPC methods and ui/apifox.js;
- from v1.0.0 the fork no longer tracks upstream: it adds `# @file_id` /
  `# @interface_id` comments (plain comments, non-standard, honoured by this
  plugin only), per-interface call history under `_history/`, and a history
  panel. Upstream has none of these, so rebasing per release only resolves the
  same conflicts over and over. All upstream notices above stay in place.

No upstream copyright notices were removed.
